   "start": 17.62,
   "end": 20.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "George",
   "text": "It is a regular Invasion of the Body Snatchers down here."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 20.66,
   "end": 30.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "George",
   "text": "In this Land of the Dead who knows what psycho is causing this massacre- From Dusk Till Dawn from Crystal Lake to Elm Street, nobody is being left behind!"
  },
  {
