   "start": 30.1,
   "end": 41.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "George",
   "text": "If this Hellraiser slithers into your town we suggest you run like hell, find a Cabin in the Woods- And if anyone comes knocking... Make sure you let the right one in, or you'll be Dead by Dawn."
  },
